  <!-- 
  Container tags
    foodcontainer: for cooked food, any type of items the NPCs would normally eat as-is (for spawning the food in storage areas etc)
    fishcontainer: for raw fish / edible things harvested from creatures, for spawning them in e.g. fisherworkstation, chef's workstation or some kitchen areas
